{"task_id": "Mbpp/629", "solution": "def Split(numbers):\n    \"\"\"Return a list of integer even numbers from 'numbers' preserving order.\n    Integer-valued floats are treated as ints; non-integer floats are excluded.\n    \"\"\"\n    out = []\n    for item in numbers:\n        int_value = None\n        if isinstance(item, int):\n            int_value = item\n        elif isinstance(item, float) and item.is_integer():\n            int_value = int(item)\n\n        if int_value is not None and int_value % 2 == 0:\n            out.append(int_value)\n    return out"}
